              <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400 bg-blue-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-400/30">
                Interactive Trade Underwriting Engine
              </span>
              <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white">Underwrite Any Commercial Enterprise</h2>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 max-w-xl">
                Choose from 25 standard NAICS trades or enter your own custom business concept to underwrite establishment density, commercial lease rates, and daily transaction breakeven for {city.name}.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="shrink-0 w-full md:w-96 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <label for="trade-select" class="block text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Select Trade or Custom:</label>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  id="toggle-custom-btn"
                  class="text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-300 hover:text-white underline cursor-pointer"
